           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: High-dimensional factor model based on functional principal component
    analysis (FPCA) using variational inference. This package is a derivative of
    bayesSYNC, developed for the EmbedSYNC project. It adds an externally
    informed prior on the spike-and-slab loading inclusion indicators, in which
    genes assigned to the same external group share a group- and factor-specific
    inclusion probability. It is installed and versioned independently of
    bayesSYNC, so both can be used side by side.
